WEBVTT

00:42.042 --> 00:45.336
SEPTEMBER 08, 2011
50 DAYS OF DATING

00:47.005 --> 00:50.258
Yeon-su asks strange questions
from time to time.

00:50.341 --> 00:51.718
What if…

00:52.552 --> 00:55.889
- What?
- I get into college, but you don't?

00:58.057 --> 01:00.518
- I will.
- At this rate, I doubt it.

01:01.436 --> 01:02.937
Do you want me to fail?

01:03.021 --> 01:05.565
No, it's just a what-if question.

01:05.648 --> 01:08.359
What if I get in
but you have to resit the exam?

01:08.443 --> 01:09.944
What will happen to us?

01:10.028 --> 01:11.404
Well…

01:11.905 --> 01:14.115
First, that won't be the case.

01:14.741 --> 01:17.118
But if that happens,

01:17.911 --> 01:19.871
I'll study somewhere near your school.

01:19.954 --> 01:23.166
And I'll pack lunch
and study by your side.

01:27.712 --> 01:29.047
Do you like me that much?

01:33.635 --> 01:35.637
Hey. Why aren't you answering me?

01:36.763 --> 01:37.764
Hey.

01:37.847 --> 01:40.642
Just focus on sweeping, will you?

01:40.725 --> 01:43.853
- You're slacking off.
- I said do you like me that much?

01:46.731 --> 01:48.316
- What's the matter with you?
- Hey.

01:48.399 --> 01:49.943
340 DAYS OF DATING

01:50.026 --> 01:52.612
- What?
- What if…

01:52.695 --> 01:54.155
She'd ask out of nowhere.

01:54.239 --> 01:55.365
What is it this time?

01:55.448 --> 01:57.325
What if you secretly go on a blind date?

01:57.408 --> 02:00.578
Don't be ridiculous. Why would I do that?

02:00.662 --> 02:02.288
Then what if I do?

02:02.372 --> 02:03.498
You're going on a blind date?

02:04.999 --> 02:06.292
No.

02:07.252 --> 02:10.797
- It's just a what-if question.
- Ji-ung will spy on you.

02:10.880 --> 02:13.091
Ji-ung? As if.

02:13.675 --> 02:16.344
I'll stay by your side
at all times to make sure you don't.

02:19.806 --> 02:21.724
What? I'm serious.

02:21.808 --> 02:24.811
I know you finish class at 5 p.m. today.
I'll see you soon.

02:24.894 --> 02:26.312
But we met yesterday.

02:26.396 --> 02:30.775
- Ung, you must really like me.
- Class is starting.

02:30.859 --> 02:32.527
- Bye.
- Hey.

02:32.610 --> 02:37.907
750 DAYS OF DATING

02:39.409 --> 02:43.705
What if I never get better?

02:45.039 --> 02:47.500
What? Don't exaggerate.
Your fever went down a lot.

02:47.584 --> 02:50.753
No, it's just a what-if question.

02:51.546 --> 02:54.841
What if I never get better and--

02:54.924 --> 02:57.552
What? Don't be ridiculous.

03:00.597 --> 03:04.434
I think Yeon-su enjoys watching me suffer.

03:04.517 --> 03:07.437
You're all better.
Get up and have some porridge.

03:16.613 --> 03:20.408
There was a specific answer
that I wanted to hear from him.

03:20.909 --> 03:23.578
1,565 DAYS OF DATING

03:23.661 --> 03:25.455
Ung was strange.

03:26.205 --> 03:27.373
- Hey.
- What?

03:27.457 --> 03:29.000
Are you done? Do you want to switch?

03:30.251 --> 03:31.711
What if…

03:32.295 --> 03:34.297
- Again?
- Yes. What if…

03:34.923 --> 03:37.508
I don't care. Enough with your what-ifs.

03:37.592 --> 03:40.470
What if I go abroad
as an exchange student?

03:40.553 --> 03:41.846
Did you sign up for that?

03:41.930 --> 03:43.973
No, it's just a what-if question.

03:44.057 --> 03:45.099
That would be horrible.

03:45.183 --> 03:48.144
All my friends broke up
after going abroad.

03:48.228 --> 03:51.231
I could feel that he liked me a lot.

03:51.314 --> 03:54.234
What if I get a job
and have to move to someplace far away?

03:55.068 --> 03:57.195
Then I'll follow you and find a job there.

03:57.278 --> 03:59.530
Or I'll just follow you.

03:59.614 --> 04:02.992
Why? Why do you want to be
by my side at all times?

04:04.619 --> 04:06.704
Aren't you tired of our long relationship?

04:06.788 --> 04:07.830
Aren't you?

04:08.873 --> 04:11.042
Do you like me that much or not?

04:13.670 --> 04:17.757
How should I put it?
He never said the most important thing.

04:19.300 --> 04:21.219
- You're annoying.
- How could you hit me?

04:21.302 --> 04:23.721
- Whatever. I'm going home.
- No, wait.

04:23.805 --> 04:27.100
Hey. Why are you suddenly so upset? Hey.

04:27.183 --> 04:29.185
- Hey, don't.
- Don't follow me.

04:29.769 --> 04:33.398
- Hey, what's the matter with you?
- I don't get why she keeps asking me that.

04:34.190 --> 04:36.526
He can't be that dense, can he?

04:37.151 --> 04:39.279
1,670 DAYS OF DATING

04:39.362 --> 04:42.782
And it was when I asked him
that question for the last time…

04:43.992 --> 04:45.285
How peaceful.

04:48.246 --> 04:49.706
What if…

04:50.707 --> 04:54.627
- I told you you have to stop.
- This is the last time. I promise.

04:55.211 --> 04:56.879
I don't get why you do this.

04:58.381 --> 05:00.591
What if we break up?

05:05.513 --> 05:08.224
- We won't.
- It's possible though.

05:08.308 --> 05:09.309
Not for me.

05:09.392 --> 05:10.643
- Are you sure?
- Yes.

05:11.811 --> 05:13.730
I could leave you.

05:15.440 --> 05:16.858
What if I abandon you?

05:20.570 --> 05:24.282
It's just a what-if question.
Then what will you do?

05:25.033 --> 05:26.242
- I won't see you.
- What?

05:26.326 --> 05:29.704
- I won't see you ever again.
- Ung. You're pretty heartless.

05:30.288 --> 05:32.415
- You'll never see me again?
- Never.

05:32.498 --> 05:33.666
What if I go see you again?

05:35.043 --> 05:37.211
I'll spray water, throw salt,
and kick you out.

05:38.004 --> 05:40.340
I'm not some demon
you need to drive out, you know?

05:43.509 --> 05:44.635
So…

05:48.639 --> 05:49.807
you better not leave me.

05:50.475 --> 05:53.436
He had never looked at me that way.

05:57.065 --> 05:58.816
But maybe

05:59.859 --> 06:01.986
that wasn't a what-if question for her.

06:06.991 --> 06:08.451
You…

06:26.719 --> 06:28.387
What about the salt?

06:29.222 --> 06:31.516
Seeing her here right now…

06:32.642 --> 06:35.812
How did we cross paths again?

06:39.732 --> 06:42.235
EPISODE 2
1792 DAYS OF SUMMER

06:42.318 --> 06:44.403
- Hello.
- Hello. It's just us two today.

06:44.487 --> 06:47.532
- I see. A group of two.
- Hello.

06:47.615 --> 06:51.869
I always come outside
and greet our customers.

06:51.953 --> 06:56.499
Many of them are regulars here.
They're pretty much family…

06:56.582 --> 06:58.084
Hello.

06:58.960 --> 07:00.962
Please go inside.

07:02.046 --> 07:03.339
What is this?

07:03.965 --> 07:06.884
We're filming right now. Be natural.

07:06.968 --> 07:09.637
Don't look at the camera. Look at me.

07:09.720 --> 07:11.848
- Am I being filmed too?
- Just act normal.

07:11.931 --> 07:14.308
Go inside. Go on, sir.

07:14.392 --> 07:16.561
Go inside. Don't look at the camera.

07:16.644 --> 07:19.063
You must be a regular here.

07:19.147 --> 07:20.815
- Ji-ung, what is this?
- Cut!

07:20.898 --> 07:23.443
Chang-sik, please. Come on.

07:23.526 --> 07:26.028
Consider him a producer.

07:26.112 --> 07:28.739
Just be natural and answer his questions.

07:28.823 --> 07:30.825
Stop calling him by his name.

07:30.908 --> 07:34.662
- Okay. I'll watch you.
- Okay.

07:34.745 --> 07:36.998
- Do what you need to do.
- Okay.

07:37.081 --> 07:39.667
- Let's do it again. Action.
- How fascinating.

07:39.750 --> 07:41.419
- Someone watch the counter.
- Excuse me.

07:41.502 --> 07:43.004
What a hectic day.

07:43.087 --> 07:46.299
Ji-ung, where in the world is Ung?

07:46.382 --> 07:48.509
I told him to wake up early today

07:48.593 --> 07:50.845
and help out as the cashier.
That little brat.

07:50.928 --> 07:53.264
- Gosh.
- He has trouble sleeping these days.

07:53.848 --> 07:54.849
Why is that?

07:54.932 --> 07:57.727
He's still struggling?
I thought he had gotten better.

07:58.769 --> 08:03.357
Is he pulling all-nighters
because of his drawings?

08:03.441 --> 08:08.362
Unbelievable. It's all because
he never goes outside.

08:08.446 --> 08:10.948
- Ji-ung, you should--
- No.

08:11.032 --> 08:13.242
I should buy some tonic for my boy.

08:13.326 --> 08:16.078
Honey, call Yong-tae and ask him
to concoct a tonic for him.

08:16.162 --> 08:17.622
- Okay.
- Goodness.

08:18.206 --> 08:20.041
He's not a little boy.

08:20.124 --> 08:23.753
- He's a grown man. Don't exaggerate.
- Be quiet.

08:23.836 --> 08:27.131
Ji-ung, what is Ung up to right now?

08:27.215 --> 08:29.383
He must have just fallen asleep.

08:29.467 --> 08:31.802
I'll visit him after filming today.

08:31.886 --> 08:34.096
Thanks. That'd be great.

08:34.180 --> 08:35.598
Thanks.

08:35.681 --> 08:37.350
- Come here.
- Yes?

08:37.433 --> 08:40.561
I'll visit Yong-tae later

08:40.645 --> 08:43.856
and ask him for the best tonic…

09:02.875 --> 09:04.168
- Have you--
- I'm sure

09:04.252 --> 09:07.255
you didn't come here
to ask me how I've been doing.

09:14.929 --> 09:16.430
- You look--
- I doubt you're here

09:16.514 --> 09:17.932
to tell me that I seem to be doing good.

09:23.271 --> 09:27.483
Seeing how you're not getting upset,
this must be something very important.

09:27.567 --> 09:30.820
How has he become even more unlikeable?

09:33.322 --> 09:35.157
You see…

09:35.241 --> 09:36.492
Hold on.

09:37.994 --> 09:40.288
Are you getting married?

09:42.415 --> 09:43.374
No.

09:44.417 --> 09:46.377
Fine. Keep talking then.

09:46.460 --> 09:49.171
He seems to have changed too.

09:51.924 --> 09:53.968
This is you, isn't it?

09:54.051 --> 09:55.928
- No.
- You didn't even look at it.

09:57.305 --> 09:59.265
I can tell that you're lying.

09:59.974 --> 10:01.058
You're Go-oh.

10:01.726 --> 10:04.478
- I said no.
- I didn't believe it at first.

10:04.562 --> 10:07.440
Because there was no way
you would have worked this hard.

10:07.523 --> 10:10.401
But the places you drew
looked quite familiar.

10:11.110 --> 10:12.945
You don't go to many places.

10:16.824 --> 10:18.993
- They're nothing special.
- And the interview.

10:19.660 --> 10:22.163
You once told me
that you never draw people.

10:22.246 --> 10:24.248
It's common for artists
not to draw people.

10:24.332 --> 10:26.667
Fine. Let's say these are just suspicions.

10:26.751 --> 10:27.835
And this…

10:30.212 --> 10:31.505
is proof.

10:32.840 --> 10:35.301
NJ's manager posted this
on his social media.

10:35.384 --> 10:37.303
Do you see that blurry guy in the back?

10:38.846 --> 10:40.890
That's you no matter how I look at it.

10:41.682 --> 10:42.642
You recognized me?

10:43.225 --> 10:47.229
Go-oh never shows up to his exhibitions
or even when he sells his paintings.

10:47.313 --> 10:49.940
But he met NJ in person
when she bought one from him.

10:51.567 --> 10:54.695
- I'm her fan.
- Okay. Sure, you are.

10:55.571 --> 10:58.407
Anyway, I'm here to see Go-oh,
not Choi Ung.

10:58.991 --> 11:00.034
I have a proposal.

11:01.160 --> 11:02.370
Is that so?

11:04.288 --> 11:05.289
All right.

11:06.791 --> 11:07.958
Make your pitch.

11:08.459 --> 11:11.212
I guess everyone changes
when they become successful.

11:11.295 --> 11:13.297
He's so cocky now.

11:25.184 --> 11:28.187
Sir, we'd like to do a collaboration
between Soen Shop,

11:28.270 --> 11:31.357
a premium lifestyle boutique,

11:31.440 --> 11:34.193
and your work.

11:34.276 --> 11:37.571
We were thinking if you could draw live

11:37.655 --> 11:40.616
on the opening day of Soen Shop.

11:41.367 --> 11:42.910
What do you think?

11:44.036 --> 11:45.079
I refuse.

11:46.122 --> 11:47.665
- Sorry?
- I don't want to.

11:49.667 --> 11:51.710
May I ask why?

11:51.794 --> 11:53.337
I just don't want to.

11:53.921 --> 11:54.839
But still,

11:55.673 --> 11:58.759
if you tell us why you don't want to,
we could make--

11:58.843 --> 12:02.138
No. There's no need for that. It's okay.

12:02.221 --> 12:04.807
- Hey.
- Who are you speaking to?

12:04.890 --> 12:05.766
The artist or Ung?

12:05.850 --> 12:07.852
Are you going to keep being so childish?

12:07.935 --> 12:11.021
I'm not. That's why I'm hearing you out.

12:11.105 --> 12:13.858
Why won't you do it then?
It's because of me.

12:13.941 --> 12:15.943
I don't like being in front of people.

12:16.026 --> 12:18.904
You'd know if you did your research. And…

12:19.947 --> 12:21.365
it's also because of you.

12:26.245 --> 12:27.955
You've changed quite a bit.

12:28.038 --> 12:31.876
I doubt it. I don't feel any different.

12:32.668 --> 12:35.671
Can you please stop being so immature?

12:38.424 --> 12:41.510
Anyway, read this again.
If you change your mind--

12:41.594 --> 12:43.053
Who are you talking to now?

12:43.596 --> 12:45.222
- Go-oh? Ung?
- Hey.

12:49.393 --> 12:51.479
I shouldn't have visited him.

12:52.062 --> 12:53.981
All he did was humiliate me.

12:55.357 --> 12:58.027
- Why are you here, Yeon-su?
- What?

12:58.110 --> 12:59.778
I told you I won't ever see you again.

13:01.906 --> 13:03.699
I wouldn't have come to see you
if it wasn't for this.

13:03.782 --> 13:05.242
So you're here for work?

13:05.326 --> 13:07.077
This is very important to me.

13:07.161 --> 13:10.498
Well, It doesn't seem important enough
to come find me after five years.

13:11.916 --> 13:14.585
How are you still so upset
after five years?

13:14.668 --> 13:16.879
How are you so indifferent
only after five years?

13:33.604 --> 13:34.813
What are you doing?

13:35.606 --> 13:36.565
Am I dreaming?

13:37.816 --> 13:40.444
That woman looks very similar to Yeon-su.

13:41.028 --> 13:42.279
He hasn't changed either.

13:42.363 --> 13:44.698
She even sounds like her.

13:45.491 --> 13:49.495
I can't believe I'm dreaming of you
meeting your ex-girlfriend.

13:50.704 --> 13:53.290
I think we're done here,
so you should go home.

13:55.709 --> 13:56.794
That annoying jerk.

13:58.754 --> 14:00.839
What is it?
Is this not a dream? Is this real?

14:01.924 --> 14:03.509
Why is Yeon-su here?

14:05.678 --> 14:06.804
Come on. Open the door.

14:06.887 --> 14:07.930
Okay.

14:23.320 --> 14:24.196
Who is it?

14:25.990 --> 14:28.826
Seeing how crazy everything is,
I must be dreaming.

14:28.909 --> 14:30.536
- It must be.
- What are you on about?

14:30.619 --> 14:32.162
This has to be a dream.

14:33.873 --> 14:35.583
- What?
- Good morning.

14:37.376 --> 14:39.670
It's okay. That's normal for me.

14:40.254 --> 14:41.213
It's been a while.

14:42.047 --> 14:44.049
Yes, it's been a while,
but you didn't even call.

14:44.133 --> 14:46.260
You rarely pick up at this hour.

14:46.343 --> 14:47.761
- Can I come in?
- Sure.

14:55.936 --> 14:58.105
Who are these people?

14:58.814 --> 15:00.941
- Your employees?
- Yes.

15:03.027 --> 15:03.861
Bye.

15:11.160 --> 15:14.246
Does he think he can look down on me
just because he's successful?

15:14.330 --> 15:16.248
Since when was he so great?

15:17.374 --> 15:18.500
What?

15:25.341 --> 15:26.216
Bye.

15:34.099 --> 15:37.478
I checked one thing off
my bucket list today.

15:39.063 --> 15:40.522
How dare she come here?

15:44.485 --> 15:46.445
What are you doing?
Don't keep her waiting.

15:47.029 --> 15:48.447
You must have had a guest over.

15:48.530 --> 15:51.116
Yes. I didn't expect you to come.

15:51.200 --> 15:53.494
I tend to be welcomed
even when I'm not expected,

15:53.577 --> 15:55.329
so I was a bit thoughtless. Sorry.

15:55.412 --> 15:57.081
There's no need to apologize.

16:03.420 --> 16:05.339
My name is Gu Eun-ho.

16:05.422 --> 16:06.840
I'm Ung's manager.

16:06.924 --> 16:11.637
You can ask me about his exhibitions,
purchasing his work,

16:11.720 --> 16:12.972
and anything else.

16:14.348 --> 16:17.101
Ung? Is that your name?

16:18.102 --> 16:19.979
Yes. I'm Choi Ung.

16:20.062 --> 16:20.938
I see.

16:21.563 --> 16:23.857
Did I come too early today?

16:23.941 --> 16:27.486
Not at all.
Feel free to come whenever you want.

16:27.569 --> 16:30.614
That's why the studio
is open all year round.

16:30.698 --> 16:32.950
- This is my studio--
- If you have any questions,

16:33.033 --> 16:35.369
barge in whenever you wish.

16:35.452 --> 16:38.664
We're honored someone as shabby
as you came to this precious… No.

16:38.747 --> 16:42.292
You're precious. Someone as precious
as you came to this shabby place…

16:43.377 --> 16:45.004
I'm sorry.

16:45.838 --> 16:49.425
It's okay. People tend to stutter
when they talk to me.

16:50.009 --> 16:51.010
Can I see your studio?

16:51.802 --> 16:53.929
Of course, you can. Right?

16:54.013 --> 16:57.725
It's okay, right?
Let me show you around. This way.

17:04.648 --> 17:08.527
I'll never forget this gratifying day.

17:08.610 --> 17:09.737
Sir?

17:10.237 --> 17:11.238
Coming.

17:12.114 --> 17:15.117
- Thank you for the food.
- Thank you.

17:16.201 --> 17:17.578
Your food is always delicious.

17:17.661 --> 17:20.539
Gosh, thank you so much.

17:20.622 --> 17:21.957
I hope your business flourishes.

17:22.041 --> 17:24.168
Thank you. Have a great day.

17:24.251 --> 17:25.461
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

17:26.128 --> 17:27.880
Keep walking. Just go.

17:27.963 --> 17:30.007
- You gave me a free fried egg today.
- Gosh.

17:30.090 --> 17:31.967
You never do that. Thank you.

17:32.051 --> 17:34.762
Just leave. Go.

17:35.387 --> 17:36.722
I own Seoul Hardware.

17:36.805 --> 17:39.016
- and my name is…
- Kook Yeon-su?

17:43.896 --> 17:47.983
How dare you let me look this ugly
in front of her?

17:48.567 --> 17:49.610
You traitor.

17:49.693 --> 17:51.111
This has to be

17:51.737 --> 17:53.572
a gratifying moment, right?

17:54.156 --> 17:55.532
Sir.

17:55.616 --> 17:57.659
This was the moment I've been waiting for.

17:57.743 --> 17:58.577
Sir?

18:00.537 --> 18:01.705
She's calling you.

18:01.789 --> 18:04.041
- Yes?
- Can you draw something for me?

18:04.124 --> 18:06.710
- What is it?
- There's something I'd like you to draw.

18:06.794 --> 18:10.297
I see. But I don't draw people.

18:10.380 --> 18:13.842
I usually draw backgrounds
such as buildings or trees.

18:13.926 --> 18:16.095
It's a building. My building.

18:17.012 --> 18:19.223
- Sorry?
- Please draw the buildings I own.

18:19.306 --> 18:22.184
- Make them look pretty.
- She's incredible.

18:22.935 --> 18:25.354
I find no joy in my life these days.

18:25.437 --> 18:27.815
I'm bored no matter what I do.

18:27.898 --> 18:30.984
This isn't why I worked so hard
all throughout my life.

18:31.068 --> 18:31.902
Oh, dear.

18:31.985 --> 18:36.031
But when I look at my buildings…
How should I put it?

18:36.698 --> 18:38.158
It feels refreshing.

18:38.826 --> 18:42.329
I feel more lively, have an appetite,
and sleep well at night.

18:43.038 --> 18:45.290
Looking at them gives me
a sense of reassurance.

18:45.374 --> 18:46.750
I'm glad.

18:47.584 --> 18:50.295
That's how I feel
when I look at your work too.

18:50.379 --> 18:52.506
I see. Thank you.

18:59.763 --> 19:01.974
I find peace and balance.

19:03.433 --> 19:06.895
Buildings are the only things
that remain the same.

19:06.979 --> 19:08.689
Do you own properties too?

19:09.273 --> 19:11.817
Of course not.
He's paying monthly rent for this place.

19:11.900 --> 19:14.695
So what do you say?
Can you draw one for me?

19:14.778 --> 19:17.990
It'll benefit you if they find out
that I bought another work of yours.

19:18.073 --> 19:20.826
Well, do you think it'll be okay?

19:20.909 --> 19:22.369
You're an idol.

19:22.452 --> 19:26.206
It may tarnish your reputation if people
find out that you own properties.

19:26.290 --> 19:27.457
I don't care.

19:27.541 --> 19:29.877
I couldn't find any joy in life

19:29.960 --> 19:32.462
because I had to maintain
this image people had of me.

19:33.422 --> 19:36.049
I'm going to do
whatever I want from now on.

19:36.842 --> 19:37.926
I see.

19:38.010 --> 19:40.053
Then let me think about--

19:40.762 --> 19:41.930
I'm sure he can do it.

19:43.140 --> 19:46.393
By the way,
didn't you say you were a fan of mine?

19:47.144 --> 19:48.729
Yes, I did.

19:49.396 --> 19:51.398
You don't seem like one today.

19:52.065 --> 19:53.984
Are you already sick of me?

19:55.068 --> 19:55.986
What do you mean?

19:57.613 --> 20:00.741
It just seems like
you're distracted today.

20:03.118 --> 20:05.329
I tend to notice things like this easily.

20:06.413 --> 20:08.290
Oh, that's not why--

20:08.373 --> 20:10.834
I should get going. See you next time.

20:11.460 --> 20:14.129
Let me escort you.

20:27.768 --> 20:29.937
Why does it keep bothering me?

20:35.067 --> 20:36.485
How childish of him.

20:36.568 --> 20:38.862
I don't need him to do me this favor.

20:38.946 --> 20:40.948
I have my pride too.

20:41.031 --> 20:43.659
I'll never let him humiliate me
like this ever again.

20:43.742 --> 20:45.369
I hope you weren't bluffing

20:45.452 --> 20:47.120
when you said you could
get the artist on board.

20:47.204 --> 20:49.623
You're not that pathetic, are you?

20:51.458 --> 20:52.793
I shouldn't have overreacted.

20:54.628 --> 20:57.172
Should I beg him just this once?

20:58.757 --> 20:59.841
No.

21:00.384 --> 21:01.843
He even threw salt at me.

21:08.558 --> 21:10.769
Why were you so distracted?

21:11.561 --> 21:12.813
Hey.

21:12.896 --> 21:14.690
Be careful. It's a narrow alley.

21:14.773 --> 21:17.234
It's been ages.

21:17.317 --> 21:18.777
What brings you here?

21:18.860 --> 21:20.946
I should ask you that question.

21:21.029 --> 21:22.447
Why are you here?

21:22.531 --> 21:24.324
Right. You live here too.

21:24.908 --> 21:26.827
Don't tell me you're here to see Choi Ung.

21:27.411 --> 21:30.539
Don't even get me started.
I came to see the great Go-oh,

21:30.622 --> 21:33.292
- but he treated me like a doormat.
- What do you mean?

21:33.375 --> 21:36.420
Will he never grow up?
He became even more immature.

21:36.920 --> 21:39.798
Did he spray water and throw salt at you?

21:40.632 --> 21:41.842
How did you know?

21:41.925 --> 21:45.053
He practiced doing that
on Eun-ho more than 50 times.

21:45.137 --> 21:46.096
What?

21:46.179 --> 21:47.889
He's crazier than you think.

21:51.143 --> 21:54.688
I had no idea
you'd actually come see him again.

21:54.771 --> 21:56.815
I guess his practice paid off.

21:57.399 --> 21:58.567
It's driving me nuts.

21:59.776 --> 22:02.362
I can't believe I thought
I could talk with him.

22:02.946 --> 22:05.198
- I must have been out of my mind.
- What's wrong?

22:05.282 --> 22:08.035
I had to see him regarding work.

22:10.620 --> 22:13.915
Forget it. What can I do
with that lost cause?

22:13.999 --> 22:15.292
Bye.

22:19.713 --> 22:21.923
Sorry. Look at me.

22:22.007 --> 22:23.717
We haven't met in ages.

22:25.010 --> 22:27.429
How have you been, Ji-ung?

22:41.735 --> 22:43.445
Was I too harsh with the salt?

22:55.123 --> 22:57.918
Grandma, let's eat.

22:58.001 --> 22:59.002
Okay.

22:59.086 --> 23:00.337
My goodness.

23:01.004 --> 23:02.964
Is it already dinner time?

23:03.048 --> 23:04.925
Yes. Eat up and go to bed.

23:05.008 --> 23:06.635
What time is it?

23:07.344 --> 23:09.721
I need to stay up for the drama.

23:09.805 --> 23:11.890
It hasn't started yet. Eat first.

23:14.059 --> 23:16.937
How could someone be so beautiful
and have glowing skin?

23:17.979 --> 23:22.234
Oh, come on.
I just washed my face. That's all.

23:22.317 --> 23:24.444
I've seen her on TV often lately.

23:24.528 --> 23:27.280
How could all her facial features

23:27.364 --> 23:29.866
fit in that tiny face of hers?

23:30.992 --> 23:33.578
Grandma, who's prettier? She or me?

23:33.662 --> 23:34.830
What are you on about?

23:34.913 --> 23:37.874
What? You're really hurting my feelings.

23:37.958 --> 23:40.168
I'm your granddaughter,
and she's a stranger.

23:40.252 --> 23:42.003
She must have a grandma too.

23:42.087 --> 23:45.632
What?
What kind of ridiculous answer is that?

23:45.715 --> 23:47.676
It's the perfect answer
to your absurd question.

23:47.759 --> 23:49.803
Eat up. The food will get cold.

23:50.428 --> 23:53.473
You're unbelievable.
I have your exact personality.

23:53.557 --> 23:56.059
That's why I'm so hot-tempered.

23:56.143 --> 23:58.311
Being hot-tempered
is a must if you're poor.

23:58.395 --> 23:59.980
Don't let others look down on you. Okay?

24:01.982 --> 24:04.067
I've been too kind these days, haven't I?

24:05.277 --> 24:07.320
Maybe that's why
I feel so down these days.

24:07.404 --> 24:09.948
What? Did someone look down on you?

24:10.031 --> 24:13.160
Who was it? Who made you feel that way?

24:13.243 --> 24:14.828
What a scumbag.

24:14.911 --> 24:17.164
Let me have at those jerks.

24:17.247 --> 24:19.958
I'll teach those brats a lesson.

24:20.041 --> 24:21.668
You're definitely my grandma.

24:24.337 --> 24:25.964
Grab this black part

24:26.047 --> 24:27.757
and push it in. It's very simple.

24:27.841 --> 24:29.050
Bring it outside.

24:29.134 --> 24:30.510
- Okay.
- All right.

24:43.440 --> 24:44.649
- Sir.
- Yes?

24:44.733 --> 24:46.776
- Two dark beers for table five.
- Okay.

24:46.860 --> 24:50.197
Hold on. Once you're done with that,
just go home.

24:50.280 --> 24:53.074
Why do you keep coming here
and helping us out? I feel bad.

24:53.158 --> 24:56.119
You give me an allowance.
I should do something in return.

24:56.203 --> 24:57.871
You don't have to.

24:59.539 --> 25:01.791
Sir, two more beers, please.

25:01.875 --> 25:03.210
Sure.

25:06.922 --> 25:07.923
Excuse me.

25:08.006 --> 25:09.424
One minute.

25:11.092 --> 25:14.221
Here are your dark beers. Enjoy.

25:14.304 --> 25:15.680
Yes, what would you like?

25:16.389 --> 25:18.558
- One half-and-half spicy chicken.
- Okay.

25:19.226 --> 25:20.227
One chicken salad.

25:21.519 --> 25:24.731
One tteokbokki
and one chicken feet fried rice.

25:24.814 --> 25:28.026
Okay. But why aren't you drinking?

25:28.610 --> 25:29.444
I will.

25:29.527 --> 25:31.863
- I'll get the food ready.
- Thank you.

25:37.244 --> 25:39.329
Your food is here.

25:40.205 --> 25:43.083
Tteokbokki and chicken feet friend rice.

25:43.833 --> 25:45.460
Are you sure you can finish them?

25:45.961 --> 25:48.546
Sorry? Why would you ask me that?

25:48.630 --> 25:50.382
I can, so don't worry.

25:50.465 --> 25:51.591
That's not why.

25:52.300 --> 25:53.551
This is on the house.

25:54.135 --> 25:55.679
These are crispy tenders.

25:55.762 --> 25:58.723
It's our new dish,
and it's the most popular one.

25:58.807 --> 26:00.684
Really? Are you sure this is for free?

26:00.767 --> 26:01.726
Of course.

26:01.810 --> 26:04.896
Seeing how much you've ordered,
the dishes must be scrumptious.

26:04.980 --> 26:06.773
Do you own a mukbang channel?

26:06.856 --> 26:08.775
I think I've seen you before.

26:09.943 --> 26:12.862
- You're mistaken. Thanks anyway.
- Opened a business nearby?

26:12.946 --> 26:14.572
Yes. What?

26:14.656 --> 26:18.285
It's okay. It's not bad
to size your rivals up.

26:18.368 --> 26:20.787
Many of our customers are like you.

26:20.870 --> 26:23.456
I saw you jotting something.
What did you write?

26:25.166 --> 26:26.960
Where's your shop? What's it called?

26:27.043 --> 26:30.505
- A restaurant? A bar?
- Gosh. I said you're mistaken.

26:30.588 --> 26:34.467
You're making me feel
so uncomfortable that I can't eat.

26:34.551 --> 26:37.095
You see, I'm very close with the owner.

26:37.178 --> 26:39.848
- Should I ask him for the recipes?
- Can you really…

26:40.682 --> 26:42.851
Goodness. Not at all.

26:42.934 --> 26:46.229
You're wrong. What time is it?
Oh, dear. I should get going.

26:47.063 --> 26:49.524
- The bill please.
- What about all this food?

26:49.607 --> 26:51.192
Should I pack them to-go?

26:52.235 --> 26:54.446
Yes. You can do that.

26:54.529 --> 26:58.366
I hope you savor the food slowly
and find out what the recipes are.

26:58.950 --> 26:59.951
Good luck.

27:01.369 --> 27:02.954
Damn it.

27:03.038 --> 27:04.581
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

27:11.629 --> 27:14.215
"Super tasty, extremely tasty,
incredibly tasty."

27:14.299 --> 27:16.634
Her business is going to go under.

27:30.607 --> 27:31.608
Gosh.

27:31.691 --> 27:34.903
Why are you sleeping so pitifully
when you look pitiful enough already.

27:35.820 --> 27:39.032
- I couldn't sleep well this morning.
- I heard Yeon-su came by.

27:39.115 --> 27:41.284
Get that away. It's blinding me.

27:42.285 --> 27:44.329
- How did you know?
- I ran into her.

27:46.164 --> 27:47.207
Before or after we met?

27:47.791 --> 27:51.378
- After you threw salt at her.
- Gosh, did she tell you that?

27:51.461 --> 27:54.214
She didn't have to.
I know you've been rehearsing that.

27:54.297 --> 27:55.590
Have you gone insane?

27:56.091 --> 27:59.219
I'm getting secondhand
embarrassment from what you did today.

28:02.389 --> 28:04.265
I had no idea I'd see her again.

28:05.892 --> 28:07.352
So how was it to see her again?

28:08.853 --> 28:11.272
I don't know.
I don't even remember what I said.

28:11.356 --> 28:13.441
You probably babbled on about nothing.

28:13.942 --> 28:16.444
Come on. Are you here to pick a fight?

28:21.282 --> 28:23.076
What? What is it that you want to know?

28:23.785 --> 28:24.828
Let's see…

28:25.328 --> 28:26.996
Your mental age, perhaps?

28:27.080 --> 28:28.540
Stop that.

28:30.959 --> 28:33.002
Hey. By the way,

28:33.086 --> 28:35.296
what else did she say?

28:36.089 --> 28:36.965
Not much.

28:40.135 --> 28:41.261
I see.

28:46.307 --> 28:47.934
Let's go inside. It's chilly.

28:50.019 --> 28:51.271
I'm going home.

28:52.480 --> 28:54.691
What? Then why did you come here?

28:55.525 --> 28:56.401
Beats me.

28:58.027 --> 28:59.112
Bye.

29:13.293 --> 29:14.502
Beats me.

29:18.089 --> 29:19.799
Grandma, I'm off now.

29:19.883 --> 29:21.259
Remember what I told you.

29:21.342 --> 29:24.012
If anyone looks down on you, you ought to…

29:24.596 --> 29:26.222
Okay. Don't you worry.

29:28.057 --> 29:30.727
She made everything simpler.

29:31.519 --> 29:34.105
- I should be more straightforward…
- Good morning.

29:34.189 --> 29:35.523
- …and fix the issue.
- You too.

29:36.858 --> 29:39.360
Ms. Kook, you look like
you're in a good mood today.

29:39.444 --> 29:40.737
Really?

29:40.820 --> 29:42.614
I'll tell him that I couldn't cast Go-oh

29:42.697 --> 29:45.283
and propose an outstanding alternative.

29:45.366 --> 29:48.578
I'll show him what I'm made of
so he won't look down on me anymore.

29:48.661 --> 29:50.663
Oh, and Mr. Bang is with--

29:50.747 --> 29:52.165
Hey, Ms. Kook.

29:53.291 --> 29:56.753
Mr. Jang Do-yul visited us
early in the morning.

29:56.836 --> 29:59.672
I heard the project is going well.

30:00.924 --> 30:02.133
I thought I could do it.

30:02.217 --> 30:04.093
You must clock in late, Ms. Kook.

30:05.512 --> 30:07.472
No, you're mistaken.

30:07.555 --> 30:11.434
For a more free and creative
work environment,

30:11.518 --> 30:13.144
our employees clock in whenever.

30:13.228 --> 30:16.231
Creativity stems from
great work environment after all.

30:16.314 --> 30:20.151
I didn't expect to see you here
so early on a Monday morning.

30:20.235 --> 30:22.070
We have some matters to discuss,

30:22.153 --> 30:25.615
and I'd like to attend
Soen Shop's soft launch together.

30:25.698 --> 30:27.951
All right. Come with me, sir.

30:28.034 --> 30:31.120
I'll go with Ms. Kook.
Isn't she in charge of this project?

30:31.704 --> 30:35.458
Exactly. Going there with a hands-on staff
would be the most efficient.

30:35.542 --> 30:37.210
What are you doing? Go with him.

30:37.293 --> 30:38.711
Yes, sir.

30:43.341 --> 30:46.177
This was unprecedented.

30:52.475 --> 30:54.269
Mr. Jang.

30:55.770 --> 30:58.565
Did you get home safe that night?

31:03.653 --> 31:04.487
Do you…

31:06.698 --> 31:07.949
not remember what happened?

31:09.701 --> 31:10.869
Sorry?

31:20.169 --> 31:21.337
Ms. Kook.

31:22.547 --> 31:24.299
I think you're quite drunk.

31:24.382 --> 31:27.886
I told you. I don't get drunk.

31:27.969 --> 31:30.597
So why would you think that?

31:31.431 --> 31:34.350
Then I'd appreciate it
if you walked in a straight line.

31:34.434 --> 31:36.978
And why aren't you using your umbrella?

31:37.061 --> 31:38.438
Umbrella?

31:39.022 --> 31:39.898
Umbrella…

31:40.648 --> 31:41.941
I…

31:43.359 --> 31:45.904
I don't have an umbrella.

31:47.238 --> 31:49.991
Unfortunately, I don't have…

31:51.409 --> 31:55.038
I don't have an umbrella…

31:55.121 --> 31:58.541
My umbrella…

32:01.461 --> 32:05.840
What is this flashback that I'm having?

32:15.600 --> 32:16.893
Aren't you getting out?

32:17.685 --> 32:19.312
Yes. I am.

32:24.108 --> 32:25.360
We should take my car.

32:26.194 --> 32:27.195
Okay.

32:51.052 --> 32:52.428
Mr. Jang.

32:53.096 --> 32:54.514
Yes, Ms. Kook.

32:54.597 --> 32:56.933
I think

32:57.016 --> 33:00.728
someone is stealing your car right now.

33:03.940 --> 33:06.401
He's not stealing it. He's driving it.

33:06.484 --> 33:09.070
Don't you worry about a thing.

33:09.153 --> 33:11.531
I'll keep a close eye on him.

33:13.282 --> 33:14.742
Okay. Thank you.

33:14.826 --> 33:16.911
Is she okay?

33:16.995 --> 33:18.037
Sir!

33:18.121 --> 33:21.040
Sir, please be careful.

33:21.124 --> 33:23.292
Jang Do-yul has a nasty temper.

33:23.960 --> 33:26.546
He won't show you any mercy.

33:26.629 --> 33:28.756
You know I can hear you, right?

33:35.513 --> 33:37.557
You're awfully quiet, Ms. Kook.

33:38.766 --> 33:41.310
- Sorry?
- Do you remember now?

33:42.145 --> 33:46.357
No. I'm afraid I don't know
what you're talking about.

33:47.316 --> 33:48.151
You do.

33:49.277 --> 33:50.820
I don't understand.

33:50.903 --> 33:52.655
How much do you remember?

33:52.739 --> 33:56.200
Do you remember calling me a sociopath?

33:56.868 --> 33:57.869
What?

34:01.581 --> 34:04.834
You think you're a sociopath.

34:04.917 --> 34:05.835
Sorry?

34:07.879 --> 34:10.506
You're a cold-hearted man

34:10.590 --> 34:13.509
who won't hesitate
to walk all over someone

34:13.593 --> 34:15.887
to achieve success.

34:17.847 --> 34:19.098
Are you talking about me?

34:19.182 --> 34:22.518
"I may not be able
to empathize with others,

34:22.602 --> 34:25.188
but I'm a cold-hearted man

34:25.271 --> 34:27.565
who's intelligent and good at his job."

34:28.524 --> 34:29.650
Ms. Kook--

34:29.734 --> 34:31.194
Unbelievable.

34:32.403 --> 34:36.783
TVs really give off the wrong image.

34:36.866 --> 34:40.244
My grandma and I watch this drama,

34:40.328 --> 34:43.581
and there's also this character
who's just like you.

34:44.207 --> 34:48.336
People think those bastards are amazing.

34:49.003 --> 34:50.671
but they're just losers.

34:51.881 --> 34:53.883
Ms. Kook.
Don't do something you'll regret--

34:53.966 --> 34:58.179
Stop cutting me off. Will you?

34:59.138 --> 35:03.309
Why do you keep cutting me off?

35:03.935 --> 35:08.231
How would you like it
if I cut your neck off?

35:21.285 --> 35:25.289
Mr. Jang, I'm truly sorry
for what I've done.

35:25.373 --> 35:26.415
I'm really sorry.

35:26.499 --> 35:28.876
So you remember that.

35:28.960 --> 35:30.837
I'm extremely sorry.

35:30.920 --> 35:33.214
I have no excuses.

35:33.297 --> 35:34.674
I was drunk and made a huge--

35:34.757 --> 35:37.218
I thought you never got drunk.
You were incredible.

35:40.429 --> 35:43.766
What can I do for you to forgive me?

35:44.350 --> 35:47.603
It's fine. Please just make sure
this upcoming project goes smoothly.

35:48.771 --> 35:51.816
- Well, you see…
- We're here.

35:58.948 --> 36:01.284
Ung. Hey!

36:04.245 --> 36:06.747
- Ung.
- You startled me.

36:06.831 --> 36:09.167
- I just fell asleep.
- What is this?

36:10.334 --> 36:11.627
What about that?

36:12.295 --> 36:15.047
What is this? Who gave this to you?

36:15.131 --> 36:16.924
Oh, this? Yeon-su did.

36:17.008 --> 36:20.761
Yeon-su? No way. This is what she does?

36:20.845 --> 36:23.639
No. More importantly,
she wanted you to do this?

36:23.723 --> 36:24.724
Unbelievable.

36:24.807 --> 36:27.185
I see. So that's why she came to see you.

36:27.268 --> 36:31.022
Right. She wouldn't have stooped so low
to just come and see you.

36:31.105 --> 36:32.481
What are you talking about?

36:32.982 --> 36:35.026
- You said you'd do it, right?
- I told her no.

36:35.109 --> 36:37.612
Are you nuts? Why would you do that?

36:38.487 --> 36:40.031
Did you even read it?

36:40.865 --> 36:45.203
No. She talked about doing some live show,

36:45.286 --> 36:48.497
so I refused right away.
You know I don't do those.

36:48.581 --> 36:51.876
- You'll be drawing Soen Shop.
- What is that?

36:53.628 --> 36:57.006
It's a new boutique that has launched
in Paris, London, and now, here.

36:57.089 --> 37:00.343
Is this news to you?
You should've said yes immediately.

37:00.426 --> 37:03.471
- You of all people should have done so.
- Why?

37:04.680 --> 37:07.266
Because Jean Ferrat designed it.

37:09.310 --> 37:11.812
How do you not know this
about your favorite architect?

37:12.521 --> 37:16.317
Go to Yeon-su this instant
and tell her you'll do it.

37:16.400 --> 37:19.278
Why did you have to act all tough
and throw salt at her?

37:19.362 --> 37:20.446
What a fool.

37:21.030 --> 37:22.949
Go beg.

37:23.032 --> 37:24.033
WORLD-FAMOUS ARCHITECT, JEAN FERRAT

37:27.536 --> 37:28.704
Damn it. I won't do it.

37:29.914 --> 37:32.083
You must be crazy.
You're opting out of this?

37:34.001 --> 37:36.295
Wait right there. Let me show you.

37:38.005 --> 37:39.548
SOEN SHOP

37:40.508 --> 37:43.177
What? Today is their soft launch.

37:44.637 --> 37:45.721
Today?

37:46.847 --> 37:50.393
Go see for yourself
and decide whether you'll do it or not.

37:55.439 --> 37:57.692
NJ. It's one hour before your rehearsal.

37:57.775 --> 37:58.901
Please get ready.

37:58.985 --> 38:00.361
- Okay.
- Okay.

38:00.444 --> 38:02.446
- Let's get ready.
- He's not calling me.

38:03.197 --> 38:04.657
Who?

38:04.740 --> 38:05.783
That artist.

38:05.866 --> 38:07.243
Did he say he'd call?

38:07.326 --> 38:09.328
Yes. I asked him for a favor.

38:09.912 --> 38:11.539
He said he'd think about it and call me.

38:12.164 --> 38:13.416
How long has it been?

38:15.334 --> 38:17.169
A day and three hours?

38:17.253 --> 38:19.755
Come on. That's not a big deal.

38:19.839 --> 38:21.132
To me, it is.

38:21.966 --> 38:24.343
He's an artist.

38:24.427 --> 38:26.345
A pretty famous one at that.

38:27.096 --> 38:30.016
He must think you're a snob,
so he's taking his time.

38:31.267 --> 38:32.601
That can't be.

38:33.561 --> 38:34.770
Is he handsome?

38:35.771 --> 38:38.190
No. He looks a bit…

38:40.693 --> 38:41.610
like a fool.

38:42.486 --> 38:44.947
Oh, dear. He's just your type.

38:45.823 --> 38:47.283
Exactly.

38:47.366 --> 38:50.494
But why would he not call me
when he's just my type?

38:54.498 --> 38:56.250
Chi-seong. Is my schedule--

38:56.334 --> 38:59.045
No, it's full. It's completely packed.

39:00.379 --> 39:02.798
- Can I skip any of them?
- No, you can't.

39:02.882 --> 39:05.801
You're making up for what you skipped
in the past two weeks,

39:05.885 --> 39:07.553
so that's definitely not an option.

39:07.636 --> 39:11.849
NJ. I can see
that you're racking your brain.

39:11.932 --> 39:14.810
Can you please not do that? Please?

39:14.894 --> 39:17.313
- For my sake.
- Should I call him first?

39:18.272 --> 39:19.273
No.

39:19.857 --> 39:23.235
I've reached out to him too often
when he's not even a celebrity.

39:23.903 --> 39:27.823
No. Since he's an artist,
I guess he's kind of a celebrity.

39:28.741 --> 39:30.826
Then I guess it's no big deal.

39:42.254 --> 39:43.297
Are you going to do it?

39:45.257 --> 39:47.885
- No, I'm not.
- Then why keep watching it?

39:48.469 --> 39:51.138
- Just because.
- It looked fun to me.

39:54.266 --> 39:55.393
Why do you say that?

39:55.476 --> 39:57.728
They're so lively
as if they've been freshly caught.

39:58.396 --> 40:00.106
Are they fish or something?

40:01.148 --> 40:03.984
I liked their chemistry
and their characters.

40:04.068 --> 40:07.279
It's perfect for the early summertime.
They're awkward and young.

40:08.072 --> 40:10.908
It's a documentary
that's more exciting than most dramas.

40:11.992 --> 40:15.579
It's childish, but it also deals with
the worries people their age have.

40:16.247 --> 40:17.581
I could understand

40:17.665 --> 40:20.167
why people love it so much
and want to see them again.

40:20.251 --> 40:22.128
All they did was argue and fight.

40:22.837 --> 40:26.257
Did you see the original?
Watch it, and you'll think otherwise.

40:26.340 --> 40:29.093
The original? When did you watch that?

40:29.760 --> 40:32.388
You're in it a lot too.

40:32.471 --> 40:35.057
- You were rather cute when you were 19.
- Whatever.

40:36.183 --> 40:37.643
Anyway, take a look at it.

40:38.727 --> 40:40.896
No, thanks. I have no time for that.

40:40.980 --> 40:43.315
I'm off to a shoot.

40:43.399 --> 40:44.400
Bye.

40:52.074 --> 40:53.284
EDITING ROOM

41:11.469 --> 41:14.138
Gosh. Why am I doing this?

41:15.890 --> 41:17.057
SBC SPECIAL

41:53.719 --> 41:56.388
The barricades might take up
too much space on the opening day.

41:56.472 --> 41:58.057
- We should remove them.
- Okay.

41:58.140 --> 41:59.808
Hello. This way.

42:02.311 --> 42:05.731
We should make it so
that the guests can tour…

42:06.357 --> 42:08.067
I'll send you an email.

42:08.150 --> 42:11.070
Should I put these items
where they're more visible?

42:14.240 --> 42:15.324
Mr. Jang?

42:18.077 --> 42:19.078
Okay.

42:20.538 --> 42:21.664
That's good.

42:24.750 --> 42:27.503
So? Do you still not want to do it?

42:28.754 --> 42:31.090
Take a look inside.
You'll change your mind.

42:37.221 --> 42:38.597
- Sir.
- Yes?

42:38.681 --> 42:41.225
They're taking turns inspecting
the elevators.

42:41.308 --> 42:42.601
It'll take about 15 minutes.

42:42.685 --> 42:44.937
That's fine. We'll take the escalator.

42:45.020 --> 42:46.105
Let's go.

42:49.858 --> 42:51.902
Our key features
are furniture and lighting,

42:51.986 --> 42:55.072
so put them at the top
of the product placement list.

42:55.155 --> 42:56.574
Also, please utilize

42:56.657 --> 43:00.035
all the areas
within the shop for publicity.

43:00.703 --> 43:02.997
And please make a list of products

43:03.080 --> 43:05.833
that can be showcased in dramas,
variety shows, or documentaries.

43:05.916 --> 43:07.001
Yes, sir.

43:07.084 --> 43:10.004
- Also, about that collaboration--
- Yeon-su.

43:10.087 --> 43:10.963
Yeon-su!

43:18.053 --> 43:20.848
We'll go up. Stay there. Hold on.

43:21.765 --> 43:23.642
I'm sorry.

43:25.060 --> 43:27.271
That's fine.
Should I give you some privacy?

43:27.354 --> 43:28.981
No, you can continue.

43:31.233 --> 43:32.985
Over here.

43:33.068 --> 43:34.445
Hey, Yeon-su.

43:34.528 --> 43:36.238
Here you are.

43:36.822 --> 43:38.532
I brought him here. Aren't you glad?

43:38.616 --> 43:41.410
Hey, drag him out of here.

43:41.493 --> 43:43.245
I didn't want to come here.

43:43.329 --> 43:45.998
I heard you wanted to work with him.

43:47.207 --> 43:48.834
You might as well tell everyone.

43:52.129 --> 43:54.757
Eun-ho, I'm working right now.

43:54.840 --> 43:57.593
Ms. Kook, I can give you
some privacy if you need it.

43:57.676 --> 43:58.844
No, that's okay.

43:59.887 --> 44:03.807
Excuse me, but are you working with her?

44:03.891 --> 44:07.144
Yes. He's the marketing team leader
of Soen Shop.

44:07.227 --> 44:09.521
Really? No way.

44:09.605 --> 44:12.149
We're very interested in this shop.

44:12.232 --> 44:14.360
Ung, did you hear that?
He's the team leader.

44:14.443 --> 44:16.028
Stop embarrassing me. Let's go.

44:16.111 --> 44:19.073
This is only our soft launch,
so it's still a bit hectic.

44:19.156 --> 44:21.950
But I hope you enjoy it.
And if there's any inconvenience

44:22.034 --> 44:25.496
or if you have any suggestions,
please tell our employees on your way out.

44:25.579 --> 44:26.664
Sure, we will.

44:26.747 --> 44:28.874
You're very friendly.

44:29.500 --> 44:32.670
Yeon-su, call me when you're done.
My number is…

44:32.753 --> 44:35.214
Never mind. You can just call Ung.

44:35.297 --> 44:36.632
Make sure you call--

44:37.216 --> 44:38.592
Don't forget to call.

44:41.261 --> 44:42.554
I'm sorry, sir.

44:42.638 --> 44:45.140
It's okay. They're interesting people.

44:49.395 --> 44:50.521
What's the matter?

44:51.438 --> 44:55.067
I'm just surprised
that you weren't offended by--

44:55.150 --> 44:57.277
Is it because
I didn't act like a sociopath?

44:57.361 --> 44:59.571
No. That's not what I meant.

45:00.155 --> 45:01.990
- Let's go.
- Okay.

45:08.080 --> 45:12.126
Why is that team leader so good-looking?

45:13.293 --> 45:17.214
They look like a couple and
not work partners that they're together.

45:17.297 --> 45:18.382
You bastard.

45:19.174 --> 45:22.094
How could you tell everyone
about my identity when you're my manager?

45:22.177 --> 45:24.638
Come on. Are you Batman or what?

45:24.721 --> 45:27.391
Why do you keep trying so hard
to hide your identity?

45:27.474 --> 45:29.601
- Shut up.
- Hold up. Are you leaving already?

45:29.685 --> 45:32.020
You're not going to talk with Yeon-su?

45:32.104 --> 45:33.313
I'm going upstairs.

45:34.857 --> 45:37.901
Look at you.
You're totally into this place.

45:39.695 --> 45:42.364
NJ, take a deep breath
at the count of two.

45:42.448 --> 45:44.950
Here we go. One, two.

45:46.368 --> 45:48.912
Done. Okay. Good.

45:52.040 --> 45:54.376
- Unzip me.
- What? Why?

45:54.460 --> 45:56.503
- Hurry up.
- Why?

45:56.587 --> 45:58.714
I did it. What's wrong?

45:58.797 --> 45:59.798
MR. CHOI UNG
READ

46:00.507 --> 46:01.341
Is he crazy?

46:02.593 --> 46:04.052
How could he ignore my text
when he's read it?

46:04.136 --> 46:05.137
That artist?

46:05.929 --> 46:07.806
You've met your match.

46:09.224 --> 46:11.018
He must be writing his reply.

46:11.101 --> 46:12.978
He's just being prudent, right?

46:13.061 --> 46:14.313
How long has it been?

46:15.063 --> 46:16.148
Thirteen minutes?

46:16.231 --> 46:18.692
I really don't get
young people these days.

46:18.775 --> 46:20.486
It's only been 13 minutes.

46:20.569 --> 46:21.737
How childish.

46:23.071 --> 46:25.532
He didn't strike me as the prudent type.

46:26.033 --> 46:27.576
Why is he ignoring me?

46:31.205 --> 46:32.956
Take this off.

46:33.040 --> 46:34.166
- Chi-seong.
- Yes?

46:34.249 --> 46:35.584
She's at it again.

46:35.667 --> 46:37.127
What is it this time?

46:38.378 --> 46:40.047
I can skip the rehearsal.

46:40.756 --> 46:42.049
I need to go out for a bit.

46:56.063 --> 46:57.648
Mr. Jang.

46:58.148 --> 46:59.775
I have something to tell you.

47:00.484 --> 47:01.318
Go ahead.

47:02.653 --> 47:04.655
It's about the collaboration

47:04.738 --> 47:07.282
- with that artist.
- Okay.

47:08.200 --> 47:10.410
I don't think it'll pan out.

47:13.080 --> 47:14.206
Why not?

47:14.289 --> 47:16.750
I wasn't able to contact him.

47:16.833 --> 47:18.710
And through my research,

47:18.794 --> 47:22.631
I found out that he doesn't like
to be seen in public.

47:24.550 --> 47:26.677
- Ms. Kook--
- I know you're disappointed.

47:26.760 --> 47:28.136
I'm truly sorry.

47:28.220 --> 47:32.140
However, I promise that I'll come up
with a better alternative.

47:35.060 --> 47:37.604
You must not remember
what happened at the end.

47:37.688 --> 47:40.482
- Sorry?
- You remember calling me a sociopath

47:40.566 --> 47:43.777
but not what happened
in front of your house that night.

47:44.695 --> 47:46.446
What do you mean?

47:54.621 --> 47:57.040
I found Go-oh.

48:00.252 --> 48:03.297
I didn't want you to look down on me.

48:04.256 --> 48:06.216
That's great news.

48:06.925 --> 48:09.261
I really hoped it wasn't him.

48:10.220 --> 48:13.181
I really didn't expect it to be him.

48:14.224 --> 48:15.350
Sorry?

48:15.434 --> 48:16.893
But how…

48:17.436 --> 48:20.564
How could I possibly see him again?

48:23.150 --> 48:24.568
What do you mean?

48:24.651 --> 48:27.362
How could I…

48:29.573 --> 48:33.702
see that bastard, Choi Ung, again?

48:39.374 --> 48:42.544
Do you personally know Go-oh?

48:43.503 --> 48:47.090
It's been five years since we broke up.

48:49.926 --> 48:50.927
Hey.

48:52.554 --> 48:53.680
Ms. Kook?

48:53.764 --> 48:56.266
Of all the people…

48:58.226 --> 49:02.272
how could I face Ung again?

49:05.192 --> 49:09.154
What in the world did I tell him?

49:16.495 --> 49:18.872
- That man earlier was Go-oh, wasn't he?
- Well--

49:18.955 --> 49:20.999
He seems to know about this project.

49:21.083 --> 49:23.710
If you're uncomfortable
about working with him,

49:23.794 --> 49:27.839
we're willing to replace you
with someone else and proceed with it.

49:27.923 --> 49:30.676
- Mr. Jang--
- Since you were in charge from the start,

49:30.759 --> 49:32.928
it'd be great if you did it.

49:33.011 --> 49:35.597
But we have no choice if you keep letting
your personal matters get in the way.

49:35.681 --> 49:37.683
- Mr. Jang.
- One minute.

49:37.766 --> 49:39.351
You can leave first.

49:39.434 --> 49:41.561
Let me know if anything
new comes up. Goodbye.

49:42.354 --> 49:43.355
Yes?

49:43.980 --> 49:45.023
What is it?

49:46.692 --> 49:47.818
It looks good.

49:50.070 --> 49:51.613
What should I do?

49:56.702 --> 50:00.831
What am I supposed to do?

50:03.500 --> 50:04.918
Aren't you getting in?

50:27.023 --> 50:28.191
Where is Eun-ho?

50:28.984 --> 50:30.235
He's already downstairs.

50:34.823 --> 50:35.991
What's going on?

50:38.160 --> 50:40.787
Right. They said they were inspecting
the elevators.

50:42.706 --> 50:43.707
EMERGENCY CALL

50:43.790 --> 50:45.876
We're in elevator number nine.
Please check.

50:50.464 --> 50:53.425
- It won't take long.
- Why aren't you surprised?

50:53.508 --> 50:54.968
Why should I be?

51:04.853 --> 51:07.147
You said you weren't interested.
Why are you here?

51:07.689 --> 51:08.982
I read the proposal today.

51:09.065 --> 51:11.568
I knew it.
You didn't even read it that day.

51:13.945 --> 51:16.948
How are you still so immature?

51:17.032 --> 51:19.534
I heard you rehearsed
spraying water and salt.

51:19.618 --> 51:22.370
- Did Ji-ung tell you that?
- Grow up, will you?

51:22.454 --> 51:23.914
Was that all you could think up?

51:27.542 --> 51:28.752
What about you?

51:29.419 --> 51:31.588
Was work the only excuse
for you to come see me?

51:38.637 --> 51:41.598
Then what excuse did you expect
to hear when you saw me?

51:50.982 --> 51:53.777
I didn't plan on
acting immature like you did.

51:54.361 --> 51:55.946
It's been five years after all.

52:02.828 --> 52:05.163
What if I was serious
and didn't act childish?

52:07.457 --> 52:09.251
Would you have managed?

52:17.384 --> 52:19.302
If you were sincere,

52:19.928 --> 52:21.263
what would you have done?

52:38.405 --> 52:40.866
I'm sorry. They must have made a mistake.

52:40.949 --> 52:42.576
No, it's okay.

53:00.468 --> 53:01.803
I am childish.

53:03.179 --> 53:04.514
I just ran away.

53:14.149 --> 53:15.317
Hi.

53:17.193 --> 53:18.153
What?

53:19.029 --> 53:20.655
NJ, what brings you here?

53:20.739 --> 53:24.701
- Where's your phone?
- My phone? It's right here.

53:25.535 --> 53:27.537
I see. You didn't lose it.

53:28.496 --> 53:30.165
Then why did you ignore me?

53:30.790 --> 53:34.836
Oh, that. I put it off
because I wanted to think

53:34.920 --> 53:36.796
- before replying.
- You put off my text?

53:37.589 --> 53:41.593
- Then what were you doing in the meantime?
- I went out.

53:42.260 --> 53:45.764
What are you doing here?
Why did you come here?

53:45.847 --> 53:49.559
No particular reason.
I was wondering why you ignored me.

53:49.643 --> 53:52.729
But aren't you busy?
Don't you have a packed schedule?

53:52.812 --> 53:56.107
I was going to leave in five minutes.
I have a live stage scheduled.

53:56.691 --> 53:58.443
I just had some free time.

53:59.027 --> 54:02.030
- All the way here?
- I'm usually too busy to be bored,

54:02.113 --> 54:03.782
but things have changed these days.

54:04.366 --> 54:07.661
I wanted to see what you were doing
instead of replying to my text.

54:08.370 --> 54:09.496
What?

54:10.246 --> 54:12.207
You're very…

54:14.000 --> 54:15.085
Well…

54:15.919 --> 54:17.087
Unique.

54:17.671 --> 54:21.424
- I'm running late. Goodbye.
- Is that really why you came here?

54:21.508 --> 54:24.302
If you want to find out,
ignore my text again.

54:24.970 --> 54:25.845
Let's go.

54:37.774 --> 54:38.817
SBC SPECIAL
HWIYEONG HIGH SCHOOL

55:20.942 --> 55:21.943
Hey.

55:23.111 --> 55:25.613
I'll do it. I'm up for it.

57:14.514 --> 57:15.890
SBC SPECIAL

57:30.947 --> 57:32.532
What? What do you want me to do?

57:33.825 --> 57:35.493
- What?
- You need to do it.

57:36.911 --> 57:39.622
Gosh, don't annoy me.

57:40.206 --> 57:42.959
I need to do it, so you have to do it too.

57:43.042 --> 57:45.378
- Does Dad want to film me too?
- No, not that.

57:46.129 --> 57:47.213
You and Yeon-su.

57:48.006 --> 57:50.592
Let's film that documentary again.

57:59.017 --> 58:00.310
Are you insane? Why would I?

58:00.935 --> 58:03.271
Do you think I'm a doormat?

58:05.106 --> 58:07.817
Hello, my name is Choi Ung.

58:07.901 --> 58:10.195
EPILOGUE

58:10.278 --> 58:11.905
My name is…

58:15.909 --> 58:18.453
Gosh, do we really have to do this?

58:32.133 --> 58:39.140
1792 DAYS OF SUMMER

58:54.489 --> 58:57.867
Why do you think people decide
to star in a documentary?

58:57.951 --> 58:59.827
My skin used to be so elastic.

59:00.787 --> 59:03.039
Oh, things I hate?
It's still Kook Yeon-su.

59:03.122 --> 59:06.084
To put Ung and Yeon-su together…

59:06.167 --> 59:07.585
Wouldn't that be disastrous?

59:07.669 --> 59:08.962
Wait. My crutch!

59:09.712 --> 59:12.924
Why would I? You mean nothing to me.

59:13.007 --> 59:15.593
She's so selfish
and always so full of herself.

59:15.677 --> 59:17.178
Let's see who wins.

59:17.262 --> 59:20.932
How precious it is to be able to
capture and store a moment in your life.

59:21.015 --> 59:22.350
Be honest with me.

59:22.433 --> 59:24.269
Does that really mean nothing to you?

59:27.397 --> 59:31.484
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
